ot included on this site: the City Council's open data system (SAPL) does not have it.","Some laws are missing from this City Council's SAPL system (numbers 662 to 676 are not there), so the number of laws signed is left out of the mayor's profile.","This City Council's SAPL system records no veto since January 1, 2025. Since there is no way to tell whether there was no veto or it was not recorded, the mayor's profile does not show the number of vetoes."],"conferido":"2026-10-27"}},"atualizado":"2026-10-29","onde":{"camara":{"site":"https://www.vitoriadomearim.ma.leg.br/","sistema":"sapl","api":"https://sapl.vitoriadomearim.ma.leg.br/api/","propostas":"https://sapl.vitoriadomearim.ma.leg.br/materia/pesquisar-materia","propostasOnline":true,"sic":null,"conferido":"2026-10-23","motivo":null,"motivo_en":null},"prefeitura":{"site":"https://www.vitoriadomearim.ma.gov.br/","transparencia":null,"sic":null,"diarioOficial":null,"conferido":"2026-10-23","lido":false}}}
